.TH AVR\-JOB\-METRICS 1 "" "avr 0.1.4" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-job-metrics \- Show CPU/memory/IO gauges for a job's VM.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr job metrics
[OPTIONS] JOB_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show CPU/memory/IO gauges for a job's VM.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr job metrics job-abc123
    avr job metrics job-abc123 --source cpu --source network
    avr job metrics job-abc123 --watch
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIJOB_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Metric source (repeatable). Defaults to cpu and memory. (choices: cpu, memory, filesystem, load, disk-io, disk-ops, network; repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-start\fR \fIINTEGER\fR
Start time (Unix seconds). Defaults to execution start.
.TP
\fB\-\-end\fR \fIINTEGER\fR
End time (Unix seconds). Defaults to execution end or now.
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-watch\fR
Refresh every 5 seconds (Ctrl-C to exit).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output raw metrics responses as JSON.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-job (1),
.BR avr-job-list (1),
.BR avr-job-logs (1),
.BR avr-job-ssh (1),
.BR avr-job-view (1),
.BR avr-job-watch (1)
